WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:05.890
Speaker 1: Conspiracy theorist Alex Jones
is now claiming not only that he paid 500000

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:12.160
dollars to organize the January 6th insurrection
in Washington, D.C., but Alex Jones is claiming

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.750
that he was coordinating it with officials
from the Trump White House.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.820
Now, bear in mind, Alex Jones lies all the
time.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:26.950
He may be lying here, but he may not be, and
even if a fraction of this is true, it's a

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.419
whole new level of insanity related to those
riots.

00:00:30.419 --> 00:00:31.750
Let's check out this clip then.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:36.300
Speaker 2: The White House told me three days
before, we're going to have you lead the march,

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.380
the Secret Service, before Trump finishes
30 minutes before.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:44.490
So we'll lead you to a point, take you out
of the front row and lead you to the place

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:46.150
where they want you to start the march.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.330
And Trump will tell people go and I'm going
to meet you at the

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:51.260
Speaker 1: Capitol if Alex Jones is to be
believed.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.400
And we'll talk in a moment about whether he
is to be believed.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.690
He got his marching orders from the Trump
White House about the January 6th riots.

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:07.340
But understand that if one iota of this is
true, the White House helped coordinate the

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:12.340
January six insurrection with extremist conspiracy
theorists.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:17.760
Now, we have some reasons to think there's
at least something to this, because there

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:23.240
are other reports connecting some Trump White
House officials to the planning of the insurrection.

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:29.729
So, for example, Media Matters previously
surfaced some video of Ali Alexander, a so-called

00:01:29.729 --> 00:01:34.369
Stop the Steele organizer, bragging about
having been on the phone with people from

00:01:34.369 --> 00:01:38.080
the White House and seemed to be encouraging
physical violence.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:41.700
That video has since been taken down from
YouTube because it apparently violated some

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:42.700
guidelines.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:46.299
So there are data points suggesting this well
may be true.

00:01:46.299 --> 00:01:51.930
Now, given what Alex Jones is saying, it's
basically a full admission about his involvement,

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:56.200
regardless of whether his claims about the
Trump White House involvement are true.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.700
Is this even going to be investigated?

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.780
Is Alex Jones being investigated by the FBI
for this?

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:07.700
I mean, given the number of confessions that
are floating around, what seems missing is

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:11.159
someone's conviction to take these confessions
seriously.

00:02:11.159 --> 00:02:16.950
So plenty of reason to think that this should
at least be looked at as a serious thing.

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:18.859
And we can see where the evidence takes us.

00:02:18.859 --> 00:02:20.310
Now, on the other hand.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:23.219
Yeah, Alex Jones is a serial liar.

00:02:23.219 --> 00:02:28.959
And when he's been put into legal hot water
in the past for things he said, his lawyers

00:02:28.959 --> 00:02:32.819
run in and then they say he's merely an entertainer.

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:35.069
He's playing a character on his program.

00:02:35.069 --> 00:02:39.029
The things he says on his program aren't meant
to be taken literally or seriously.

00:02:39.029 --> 00:02:40.889
He's sort of like a performer.

00:02:40.889 --> 00:02:45.889
And if that defense sounds familiar, it is
the same defense that Fox News, his lawyers

00:02:45.889 --> 00:02:52.099
used when Tucker Carlson got into legal trouble
saying, you know, Tucker engages in hyperbole.

00:02:52.099 --> 00:02:53.790
It's not news reporting.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:57.359
What he says should not be taken literally.

00:02:57.359 --> 00:03:03.109
It's a stunningly common defense of so many
people that millions of Americans are actually

00:03:03.109 --> 00:03:07.730
getting what they believe to be news from
that, see what comes out of their mouths as

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.419
facts, or at least ostensibly facts.

00:03:10.419 --> 00:03:12.680
This is definitely a defense you will not
hear me use.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:18.180
OK, I can I can promise to you today what
I say on this show is not hyperbolic or performative

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.239
in the sense that it's not what I really believe.

00:03:20.239 --> 00:03:22.560
I might use hyperbolic language sometimes.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.329
It may occasionally be inaccurate.

00:03:24.329 --> 00:03:28.090
Sometimes I get a fact wrong and I will make
every effort to correct it.

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:33.290
My opinion may change over time, but I don't
pretend to be me.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:35.739
I am not playing a character on this program.

00:03:35.739 --> 00:03:38.700
This is not a defense you will ever hear from
me now.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.769
It would be great for Alex Jones to provide
some records.

00:03:41.769 --> 00:03:46.269
And what I mean by that is if he was really
coordinating things with the White House,

00:03:46.269 --> 00:03:51.560
unless the belief is that these were all in-person
meetings, did he have phone calls with people

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:53.019
from the White House?

00:03:53.019 --> 00:03:54.529
Then show us the phone records.

00:03:54.529 --> 00:03:55.849
Are there text messages?

00:03:55.849 --> 00:03:56.849
Are there emails?

00:03:56.849 --> 00:04:03.579
There should be some trail that would help
to show us if that Alex Jones is telling the

00:04:03.579 --> 00:04:04.579
truth.

00:04:04.579 --> 00:04:05.579
If he is.

00:04:05.579 --> 00:04:09.139
And of course, we could really use a more
credible witness than Alex Jones.

00:04:09.139 --> 00:04:13.839
But if he has the goods, this would be a good
time to present them to us.

00:04:13.839 --> 00:04:14.839
What do you think?

00:04:14.839 --> 00:04:16.130
Do you think Alex Jones is telling the truth?

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:17.250
Do you think he's lying?

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:19.670
Do you think he's simply exaggerating?

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:20.670
Let us know.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:25.340
We'll have more coverage of this on The David
Pakman Show Instagram, which you can find

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:31.350
at David Pakman show and follow me while you're
there at David Pakman.

